---

---

<section id="facilities" class="py-24 bg-gray-50 relative">
  <div
    class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-purple-100/50 rounded-full blur-[100px] -translate-y-1/2 translate-x-1/2 pointer-events-none"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-purple-900 mb-4">
        Nuestras Instalaciones
      </h2>
      <div class="w-24 h-1.5 bg-purple-600 mx-auto rounded-full mb-6"></div>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto font-medium">
        Espacios diseñados bajo normatividad COFEPRIS para garantizar la
        seguridad, comodidad y bienestar de nuestros voluntarios.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="facility-card group">
        <div
          class="img-box overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] shadow-md h-[300px] relative"
        >
          <div
            class="w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-800 to-indigo-900 flex items-center justify-center transform transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110"
          >
            <img
              src="/clinica.jpg"
              alt="consultorio"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="text-overlay bg-white w-[85%] mx-auto -mt-[50px] relative z-10 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-2 group-hover:shadow-2xl border-b-4 border-transparent group-hover:border-purple-600 text-center"
        >
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-purple-900 mb-3">Área Clínica</h3>
          <div
            class="w-10 h-1 bg-purple-500 mx-auto mb-4 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-20"
          >
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Dormitorios monitoreados, estaciones de enfermería y consultorios
            equipados para la toma de muestras y seguimiento puntual.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="facility-card group">
        <div
          class="img-box overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] shadow-md h-[300px] relative"
        >
          <div
            class="w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-700 to-purple-800 flex items-center justify-center transform transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110"
          >
            <img
              src="/estancia.jpg"
              alt="estancia"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="text-overlay bg-white w-[85%] mx-auto -mt-[50px] relative z-10 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-2 group-hover:shadow-2xl border-b-4 border-transparent group-hover:border-blue-500 text-center"
        >
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-purple-900 mb-3">
            Áreas de Estancia
          </h3>
          <div
            class="w-10 h-1 bg-blue-500 mx-auto mb-4 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-20"
          >
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Espacios confortables con entretenimiento, comedor y zonas de
            descanso para hacer la estancia de los voluntarios más amena.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="facility-card group">
        <div
          class="img-box overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] shadow-md h-[300px] relative"
        >
          <div
            class="w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-900 to-purple-900 flex items-center justify-center transform transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110"
          >
            <img
              src="/monitoreo.jpg"
              alt="monitoreo"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="text-overlay bg-white w-[85%] mx-auto -mt-[50px] relative z-10 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-2 group-hover:shadow-2xl border-b-4 border-transparent group-hover:border-indigo-500 text-center"
        >
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-purple-900 mb-3">
            Control y Monitoreo
          </h3>
          <div
            class="w-10 h-1 bg-indigo-500 mx-auto mb-4 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-20"
          >
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Farmacia con control estricto de temperatura y áreas administrativas
            para la gestión documental y aseguramiento de calidad.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
